# Consolidated urban model: sources, definitions and coverage

27 October 2026. The user closes the decision discussion and authorizes applying its agreements. The current report replaces frozen waiting targets with actual-admission assignment, movement-specific residual priority and explicit physical access. This is a consolidated mathematical realization for review, not implementation or empirical validation.

